# Project context

- Full map: `docs/DOMAINS.md`
- This repo: **Burn & Build** — full desktop web product on **burnandbuilddiet.com**
- API backend: `server/` → Render project **Burn & Build**, service `program-creator` (`program-creator-3tzd.onrender.com`)

Push to `main` deploys the static site via GitHub Pages.

## Paths

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `/` (index.html) | Marketing landing |
| `/questionnaire/` | Program questionnaire → Burn Engine (gated; redirects to checkout portal when closed) |
| `/createyourfoodplan/` | Stripe checkout + purchaser download portal |
| `/program-report/`, `/menuplanner/`, `/get-your-diet/` | Redirect → `/createyourfoodplan/` |
| `/support`, `/privacypolicy` | Support & legal |
| `/contacts/` | Admin contact list |
| `server/` | Express API + SQLite (Render) |

**Product name:** Menu planner (never “meal planner” in user-facing copy).

## Active product flow (while gate is on)

```
Purchasers → /createyourfoodplan/ → download Burn & Build Diet PDF
New programs → coming soon (questionnaire with ?create=1 for internal testing only)
```

## Print Shop (server PDF pipeline)

Print Shop PDFs are generated on the server via `server/pdf/` (PDFKit). Client menu planner UI was removed; data lives in `menuplanner/data/` for PDF renderers and audits.

Five print documents — see `js/printShopViews.js`. Verify: `npm run verify:pdf`.

## KWarner program-report preview PDF

See `.cursor/rules/kwarner-preview-pdf.mdc`. After layout changes: `npm run render:kwarner-preview` → commit samples → raw GitHub download links.
